                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e17b74a8-4f42-4ac3-8ceb-43f615cb4cd3",
                        "entry_id": "57a6f954-54dd-31e9-bae0-675ea3cbd4f4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "шке́тах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                        "entry_id": "57a6f954-54dd-31e9-bae0-675ea3cbd4f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. мальчик, подросток"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6915d9b-2991-4b1e-be15-65cea148a5bb",
                                "sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                                "text": "А он кричит: — Я, кричит, тебе, шкету, полботинки справлю. — А я говорю: — Не надо, говорю, мне полботинки. Мне, говорю, босиком больно хорошо."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2100dee-6afb-4f30-8827-b97eb4fc1ce8",
                                "sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                                "text": "❬…❭ Зал смеялся, потому что у меня и сейчас рост средний, а тогда я был вообще шкет. ❬…❭"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e085b6e-273b-4829-a5a1-d3733136b790",
                                "sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                                "text": "❬…❭ — А знаешь ли ты, шкет, чем деревенский дед Пахом отличается от интеллигента? — насмешливо спросил он однажды у .. Колюнчика."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f10bcd83-c9e7-4f88-8d30-93b17bd0ba61",
                        "source_entry_id": "57a6f954-54dd-31e9-bae0-675ea3cbd4f4",
                        "source_sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                        "target_lang_word": "lad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boy or young man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05aceb20-cc18-4a90-89d2-4bc35c05241f",
                                                "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                                "text": "How great is that danger, to which poor lads are now exposed, when placed on shipboard to learn the art of sailing! Five lads, training up for the seas, were now on board this ship; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87f94a52-3fed-4dbe-a94f-7646eb99c8f3",
                                                "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                                "text": "The lad, his son, had obtained a Jew's-harp, and learned to play upon it the profane airs of \"Yankee Doodle,\" \"Hail Columbia,\" \"St. Patrick's Day,\" and \"Auld Lang Syne.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hedonistic or irresponsible young man; A Jack the lad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d13c2e32-33c8-498c-a972-d4ccec1dd543",
                                                "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                                "text": "I think he reckons he’s a bit of a lad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ea2cf2-6e39-49c5-9f0a-9d36dcb08c9e",
                                                "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                                "text": "Last night I was out drinking with the lads."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c81b5950-9aac-379a-ab47-ff0e34ee4314",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A familiar term of address for a young man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4aafc6e7-c175-46a7-9372-b3f42044f8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "c81b5950-9aac-379a-ab47-ff0e34ee4314",
                                                "text": "Come here, lad, and help me shift these boxes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe8ccad6-b103-36c8-83a6-ed0b15309ad6",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A groom who works with horses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e255a8ed-1308-402b-b541-b296578968b5",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "— The lad stood to attention anyhow, he said with a sigh. She's a gamey mare and no mistake."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf338b52-ef45-4c74-ad12-96e9eddadf5d",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "Mrs Glynn: Oh but there's this great bit in it. You see, there was this girl, but then you find out it's not a girl but a man!\nMrs Sheridan: And he got his lad out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a115054-c916-4203-a27c-207d95e4effd",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "And he loaded the chariot with clods and boulders and cobbles that he fired at anyone who came to stare at him and jeer him, stark naked as he was, with his long lad and his acorns dangling down through the floor of the chariot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47584e51-edef-4b07-8694-8a2d6ee2ff72",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "Just thinking about how she would look without her clothes made his lad twitch with anticipation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ad3e845-950f-3243-8312-0fd9d42a8eda",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A scammer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aebfd279-e50a-4136-9a48-52f2255075fb",
                                                "sense_id": "7ad3e845-950f-3243-8312-0fd9d42a8eda",
                                                "text": "[...] regardless whether you feel the lads may deserve to be subjected to those types of images."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a4748ab-fd3e-4ebd-91a2-f862415fdad8",
                        "source_entry_id": "57a6f954-54dd-31e9-bae0-675ea3cbd4f4",
                        "source_sense_id": "db86f5c6-1818-3919-9560-ec215b8e39fb",
                        "target_lang_word": "youth",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "youth",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "526006a2-7d25-3cef-acac-9d12b7144f3d",
                                        "entry_id": "92c34871-b0c2-31e0-a6d1-8d4fee49bd91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being young."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c941d1e4-cb75-435e-a0ec-a68662650fd2",
                                                "sense_id": "526006a2-7d25-3cef-acac-9d12b7144f3d",
                                                "text": "Serene, smiling, enigmatic, she faced him with no fear whatever showing in her dark eyes. The clear light of the bright autumn morning had no terrors for youth and health like hers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed3deef2-2594-40e6-b721-ca05ee511e9f",
                                                "sense_id": "526006a2-7d25-3cef-acac-9d12b7144f3d",
                                                "text": "Feel awfully about Scott... It was a terrible thing for him to love youth so much that he jumped straight from youth to senility without going through manhood. The minute he felt youth going he was frightened again and thought there was nothing between youth and age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e964378a-d171-4996-9602-f4a03ebe0f5a",
                                                "sense_id": "526006a2-7d25-3cef-acac-9d12b7144f3d",
                                                "text": "Her youth and beauty attracted him to her."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e774d6ee-2775-3731-be3f-2866382f8578",
                                        "entry_id": "92c34871-b0c2-31e0-a6d1-8d4fee49bd91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of life following childhood; the period of existence preceding maturity or age; the whole early part of life, from childhood, or, sometimes, from infancy, to adulthood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a3e0b13-5f3e-4f7b-889d-2da0d702e8ed",
                                                "sense_id": "e774d6ee-2775-3731-be3f-2866382f8578",
                                                "text": "Make the most of your youth, it will not last forever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f70d1192-0709-4b7a-9d0b-538625559aa3",
                                                "sense_id": "e774d6ee-2775-3731-be3f-2866382f8578",
                                                "text": "I made many mistakes in my youth, but learned from them all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5568080e-3fbf-4176-9f08-f901854a49e1",
                                                "sense_id": "e774d6ee-2775-3731-be3f-2866382f8578",
                                                "text": "I don't find the pose of careless youth charming and engaging any more than you find the pose of careworn age fascinating and eccentric, I should imagine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f7cb0db-66bd-4adf-9bb6-396c07bb4640",
                                                "sense_id": "e774d6ee-2775-3731-be3f-2866382f8578",
                                                "text": "Toward the end of the war, Benoit was sent off on his own with forged papers; he wound up working as a horse groom at a chalet in the Loire valley. Mandelbrot describes this harrowing youth with great sangfroid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e6a42e5-dbee-3f5d-966d-4d7e45cf48c1",
                                        "entry_id": "92c34871-b0c2-31e0-a6d1-8d4fee49bd91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e8fc4f1-8260-450a-80b7-9406303900d1",
                                                "sense_id": "3e6a42e5-dbee-3f5d-966d-4d7e45cf48c1",
                                                "text": "There was a group of youths hanging around the parking lot, reading fashion magazines and listening to music."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6e36005-d9ec-3e57-bea2-6d5a8f916616",
                                        "entry_id": "92c34871-b0c2-31e0-a6d1-8d4fee49bd91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young man; a male adolescent or young adult."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "404a77a1-fe9c-4d50-b27d-4b01e18fdbea",
                                                "sense_id": "c6e36005-d9ec-3e57-bea2-6d5a8f916616",
                                                "text": "[…]and then a youth appeared—no one quite knew where from or to whom he belonged—but he settled down with them in a happy-go-lucky way, and they all lived together."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c6e4043-807f-3477-aff8-64d1a5e29afa",
                                        "entry_id": "92c34871-b0c2-31e0-a6d1-8d4fee49bd91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Young persons, collectively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00adae1f-5908-4b85-b18b-f8589ae07fa5",
                                                "sense_id": "7c6e4043-807f-3477-aff8-64d1a5e29afa",
                                                "text": "The actual brides- and grooms-to-be are not in attendance—many youth would be embarrassed by their parents’ matchmaking efforts, and often do not live in the same city anyway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
